Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","review_id":"5hcxsJuFWxRUxG3kFMwFWQ","date":"2013-02-09T13:00:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9538901448249817,"text_excerpt":"This was one of those meals that was perfect from the moment you walk into the restaurant up until you leave completely stuffed and satisfied. I had my eye on this place for a number of reasons: - I saw it on Best Thing I Ever Ate for the Blackened Drum, which also interested me since I never heard of nor tried Drum fish before. - I saw they had Turtle Soup, which I also always wanted to try, mainly just so I could say \"tonight I dine on turtle soup\" like Shredder. - of course, lots of high yelp reviews. K-Paul definitely did not disappoint. They start you off right with a massive bread basket, with 5 or 6 different types of bread, all piping hot and therefore delicious. The excellent wai..."},{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","review_id":"oS9EOPjdffDYslE8NQDJGw","date":"2019-08-16T00:34:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9496277570724487,"text_excerpt":"K-Pauls was our first dinner after touching down at MSY. It came highly recommended to us and I think our eyes and appetites took us into overload quite quickly, we way over ordered on everything and learned our lesson very quickly. We must share some of our meals going forward. I'd say ease into things here. We were pretty hungry and so excited to try everything, and try everything we definitely did (with the exception of dessert). We were running a little late to our reservation which wasn't a problem at all for them. I called from an our uber and when we arrived we were brought right to our table in the dining room. We started with a couple of cocktails and I quickly asked myself, why ..."},{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","review_id":"ZjKiPPLVCSpy938luJ9sTw","date":"2011-01-10T20:20:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9461463093757629,"text_excerpt":"I was pretty excited to try out K Paul's after I read the menu online. Sure, he's a celebrity chef and sure, it is where the tourists are, but I still thought it should be good and I was excited to try it out. Ambiance felt like a cozy kitchen. We ended up being seated on what appeared to be a patio out back that had been covered with a tent and closed in. Still a little drafty but overall not bad and the brick wall gave it a certain ambiance also. The website says \"business casual\" but we were all wearing jeans and nice shirts and fit right in so don't worry about it. Oh and I loved the open kitchen - I just wish we'd been seated inside so I could have watched them all cook. I started wi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","photo_id":"UMPnIk1cUMgK-wb9KvoGhQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UMPnIk1cUMgK-wb9KvoGhQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8488903045654297},{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","photo_id":"nSW16lb4UnFKWB5y8fqlXA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nSW16lb4UnFKWB5y8fqlXA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8485891819000244},{"business_id":"8NyDM-FDoWEEeEG9XUwnbg","photo_id":"W1LAMJdb8lIQKR3ZgnMROw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/W1LAMJdb8lIQKR3ZgnMROw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.83976417779922